STU, S3 Terminal UI, is an interactive terminal-based explorer for Amazon S3
(AWS S3).

With STU, you can browse buckets and objects directly from your terminal,
preview files, and download them with ease.

STU provides the following features:

- Recursive object downloads
- Previews with syntax highlighting for text files and inline rendering for
  images
- Access to previous object versions
- Customizable key bindings
- Support for S3-compatible storage
